---
// Random K-fold versus walk-forward with a purge gap, drawn on 20 time blocks.
// Cell kinds: t = train, x = test, g = purged gap (dropped from training).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 420;
const N = 20;
const CW = 34;
const X0 = 150;
const randomFold = 'ttxttttxttxtttxttxt'.padEnd(N, 't').split('');
const wf = [
  'ttttttggxxxx'.split(''),
  'ttttttttttggxxxx'.split(''),
  'ttttttttttttttggxxxx'.split(''),
];
const Y1 = 96;
const RH = 30;
const Y2 = 230;
---
<figure class="atp08-sp">
  <div class="atp08-sp-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Twenty time blocks left to right. Random K-fold: test blocks are scattered among training blocks, so the model trains on months after the ones it is tested on. Walk-forward: three folds where the training blocks always come first, then a two-block purge gap, then the test blocks.">
      <DiagramIcon name="clock" x={22} y={22} size={22} />
      <text x="44" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Where the test blocks sit decides what the model may know</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vị trí các khối test quyết định mô hình được biết những gì</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="20" y={Y1 - 18} class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Random K-fold: tests the model on the middle of a period it saw on both sides</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>K-fold ngẫu nhiên: thử mô hình ở giữa một giai đoạn mà nó đã thấy cả hai phía</tspan>
      </text>
      {randomFold.map((c, i) => <rect x={X0 + i * CW} y={Y1} width={CW - 3} height="26" rx="3" class={`c k-${c}`} />)}
      <text x={X0 - 10} y={Y1 + 18} text-anchor="end" class="lab">
        <tspan data-lang-en>one fold</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>một fold</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={X0} y={Y1 + 50} class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every train block to the right of a test block trains on that test block's future.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi khối train nằm bên phải một khối test đều là huấn luyện bằng tương lai của khối test đó.</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="20" y={Y2 - 18} class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Walk-forward with a purge gap: train, skip, then test</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Walk-forward có khoảng cách purge: train, bỏ qua, rồi mới test</tspan>
      </text>
      {wf.map((row, r) => (
        <g>
          <text x={X0 - 10} y={Y2 + r * RH + 18} text-anchor="end" class="lab">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`fold ${r + 1}`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`fold ${r + 1}`}</tspan>
          </text>
          {row.map((c, i) => <rect x={X0 + i * CW} y={Y2 + r * RH} width={CW - 3} height="24" rx="3" class={`c k-${c}`} />)}
        </g>
      ))}

      <rect x="150" y="348" width="22" height="14" rx="3" class="c k-t" />
      <text x="180" y="360" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>train</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>train</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="250" y="348" width="22" height="14" rx="3" class="c k-x" />
      <text x="280" y="360" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>test</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>test</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="350" y="348" width="22" height="14" rx="3" class="c k-g" />
      <text x="380" y="360" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>purged: label overlaps the test period</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bị purge: nhãn chồng sang giai đoạn test</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="396" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Time runs left to right. In scikit-learn's TimeSeriesSplit the gap argument does the purge: it drops that many samples before each test set.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thời gian chạy từ trái sang phải. Trong TimeSeriesSplit của scikit-learn, tham số gap làm việc purge: bỏ chừng đó mẫu ngay trước mỗi tập test.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Block counts are schematic. A real purge is as long as the label horizon: a 3-month label needs at least a 3-month gap.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số khối chỉ mang tính sơ đồ. Purge thật dài bằng chân trời của nhãn: nhãn 3 tháng cần chừa ít nhất 3 tháng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp08-sp { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp08-sp-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp08-sp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .atp08-sp text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp08-sp .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-sp .t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-sp .lab { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-sp .note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-sp .c.k-t { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .atp08-sp .c.k-x { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .atp08-sp .c.k-g { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 2; }
  .atp08-sp figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
